  m_Name: ArcadeGameHedgerow
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 94
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Hedgerow
  Description: 'Serpents only - a timed steal. Hedges of loose bricks stand round the core. Fly across
    one and stop dead just short of it: your seed wall grows across your path and eats its
    way along the hedge, and every brick it takes turns your colour. Fly on and the wall
    stands; stop again to grow another. Walls eat a rival''s trail just the same, and an
    omni crystal re-shields every wall you are growing. The most volume standing in your
    colour when the clock runs out wins. Higher intensities put longer, thicker hedges
    farther out.'
